<title>USA: FFY Financial completes tender.</title>
<headline>FFY Financial completes tender.</headline>
<dateline>YOUNGSTOWN, Ohio 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>FFY Financial Corp said consistent with preliminary results released December 23, it will purchase 808,000 shares of its common stock a $26.00 per share.</p>
<p>The value of the shares to be purchased is $21.0 million and the number of shares to be purchased represents about 15.8 percent of FFY Financial's 5.1 million shares of common stock outstanding on September 30.</p>
<p>After the transaction, there will be 4.3 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
